The Argo CD capability in argocd-capability.tf authenticates through AWS IAM Identity
Center, so hack/pre-provision-resources.sh stages
manifests/.workshop/terraform/preprovision-base (which creates the instance, the user
and the group it maps to the ADMIN role) before this directory, and orders this
directory after it.

The presence of this file is the whole signal; its contents are only documentation.
Remove it and this directory is staged with no Identity Center behind it, so the
data "aws_identitystore_group" lookup in argocd-capability.tf fails.
